{"version":1,"content":"<p>海關昨晚（27日）聯同消防處於深水埗執行反非法燃油行動，在大窩坪海水配水庫對開搗破一個流動非法加油站，檢獲約220公升懷疑未完稅汽油及一批入油工具，並拘捕流動非法加油站內一名20歲男操作員，以及光顧非法油站的35歲男司機。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:18:17.028714+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T04:46:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:38:16.141619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:18:17.028714+00:00","content_hash":"da523b2f5bffc1265da0e0af68486f24e0b5b8821bb51af9035508968e2b76cd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}